      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Voice is something which can greatly help healthcare providers because it is a genuine relational tool. Knowing one's voice means finding one's ability to receive, listen, be heard and approach others. Thus, working on one's voice helps to attain self-knowledge which naturally leads to knowledge of others and better quality care for them."},
